  <fr:mainmatter>
    <html:p>Today I have tried to make my forest a little more usable. I believe that I have finished the public/private split appropriately, and I have finally rebound keys so that I will actually use the tool!</html:p>
    <html:p>I think that I can enrich the TODO functionality by tagging with priorities and using datalog to query the priority levels.</html:p>
    <html:p>I am also curious if it would be useful to have a frontend that allows dynamic datalog queries. It would be very nice for browsing through the notes if one could search/browse a richer map of their forest.</html:p>
  </fr:mainmatter>
